### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 07: deterministic routing
### Route the interaction (scored on skills coverage, presence, priority;
### queue pinning supported). Decisions are recorded immutably.

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Route the interaction from step 04 → 200 (the decision)
# @name routeInteraction
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/routing/interactions/{{createInteraction.response.body.$.data.ID}}
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "required_skills": ["billing"],
  "priority": 5
}

###

### Decision records (immutable, filterable by interaction) → 200
# @name listRoutingDecisions
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/routing/decisions?interaction_id={{createInteraction.response.body.$.data.ID}}
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
